"""Canonical Domain Model Unit Tests — Phase 13G-1.

Tests for platform-neutral canonical entities, relationships,
cardinality, identity separation, provenance, and provider neutrality.

IMPORTANT:
    - These tests do NOT modify existing inventory tests.
    - Canonical Workload (deployment unit) != inventory Workload (utilization).
    - No provider connections are made.
"""
